g to think all  right who are people that people  understand why I brought so the reason  why I brought Sammy and Owen is because  they were the only two that hadn't  received the food reward challenge that  entire time and other than they have  only eaten everything that's been back  at Cam and so I was like if I I want to  pick Sammy and I want to pick Sammy  first this was the only strategic thing  into it especially because of that last  vote off  um Sammy was the type of person that  like can go between alliances so I  wanted to show show him that um you know  that trust and I I picked Jesse because  Jesse other than Owen was like my  clothes number one  um and he's been talking about family so  I said okay Jesse is young kids he was  the only one out of all of us who had  young kids so  I was trying to think like what's the  big like but obviously with that type of  thing everyone's going to be upset I  mean it's understandable if I didn't get  picked I would have been upset  um  I will say I do regret the one person  that I wish I brought that I did not  bring was Carla I wish I brought Carla  especially because we voted together in  that previous episode so I feel like  that I could have kept creating little  seeds to kind of work together and I  remember asking Jesse on the boat ride  to the sanctuary I'm like do you think I  should have brought Carla and he was  like I mean he's he's like no like I  think you're fine but that was eating at  me that was I was like I should have  brought her it would have been really  smart but I felt if I brought Sammy and  not all on her own not Sammy then my  strategy wouldn't have really made sense  so  yeah absolutely  um and going back to the immunity  challenge like absolutely insane I don't  even I can't even imagine what it's  actually like doing it because it was I  was sweating watching it so I was like  wow so after you know Cass wins the  immunity you guys go to tribal what was  like what was your thought process going  into tribal like were you confident in  the fact that you thought you were gonna  stay were you kind of like oh I know I'm  on The Chopping Block like what was  going through your head at tribal I was  confident that I was gonna stay but I  knew that votes were going to be  um that I was going to get voted for a  couple times from the girls  um so I was thinking you know what I'm  gonna put we're gonna put three votes on  Sammy and three votes in Carla just in  case Carl plays an art her Idol um and  then we could just re-vote  um  but Jesse does an incredible job at  going you know to me and then to Carla  and he does not tell us lies like he is  saying what both of us are saying and  they're the complete truth and that just  kind of goes to show how well he was  playing the game at that point because  we're both believing everything he's  saying  um  I think it finally like I started  getting a little inkling that I might be  going home when Jesse and Cody were in  the voting booth and they were taking a  long time they were  um and I remember that because Cody took  such a long time when he voted Mecca out  and so I was just like there's something  going on  um so I was blindsided completely  um but I I was starting to think about  it a little bit  a lot of blindsides this season not just  for viewers but literally you guys there  yeah I mean it's how it's how everybody  is playing like we're playing I mean I  think I have like made the loudest move  like out of everybody else but that  doesn't mean like that that was the best  move I mean how you have to when you go  into these games you have to  see how everybody else is playing you  have to see okay and if you want to play  some loud and energetic game and nobody  else does you're going to get voted off  um so you know the people that are  playing really quietly and are getting  moves done and are voting the people out  that they want I mean that's just it's  kudos to them so I think I just started  playing a little too loud too quickly  and I think that reward challenge coming  at that time probably wasn't the best  um but yeah I mean it just  I think uh we talked we talk about it  like a travel Council I remember with  Jeff and he was just like Jeff is always  amazed by because not a lot of us would  give him a lot of tribal because you  know you're trying to play this quiet  game he would be like I have no idea  who's going home he could never cage and  who was going home so I thought that was  really cool because I mean it's a  different way of especially the last  like however many seasons like we're  playing like a different way than  everybody else was so it was kind of it  was it was cool to be a part of but I'm  just some loud person I was always just  like I'm done playing how everyone else  wants I want to play like I want to do  this  um and lastly just quickly who do you  think like now watching everything back  who do you think is running the game  right now  at this point  um definitely Jesse and Cody  um just how they were able to  orchestrate  my Blind Side  um and it's crazy because I thought they  were my number ones like I had the best  relationship with them  um but yeah I think they're they're  definitely the ones orchestrating it but  I don't know from the preview it looks  like it looks like people are starting  to catch on so we'll see  and we will see you on the jury or not  gone yet you're still showing up and  showing out for us so the best thing my  mom had to say my mom was like just make  the jury so then like they could show  you like makeup and pretty like just do  that that's all you need to do oh I made  my mom  of course mom so I was going to be like  yes  um but so much for this chat it was  lovely talking to you and thank you so  much for sharing your story on this  season I feel like it was so important  to talk about and I'm glad it's fine was  part of the show so thank you so much  thank you
 

